Description: PagerOS Exit Node — LoRa to HTTPS bridge
 The exit-node is the project's reference Go implementation of the
 LoRa-to-Internet bridge described in SPEC.md §11. It listens for
 PagerOS device requests on a USB LoRa transceiver, forwards them as
 HTTPS calls to the public Internet, and returns the response over
 LoRa to the originating device.
